{{> header}}
<div class="page-cover-photo" style="--img: url(../img/backgroundphotos/siranush-bsls.jpg)">
    <div class="page-heading">Our Mission</div>
</div>
<div class="page-body">
    <div class="page-wrapper home-container container">
        <div class="home-div page-content-outline">
            <div class="mission fam-card col sm-24 md-24 lg-24">
                <p class="card-title">IEEE WIE's Mission <a href="http://wie.ieee.org/"><i id="social-fl" class="fa fa-external-link-square social"></i></a></p>
                <p class="fam-card-description">Our goal is to facilitate the recruitment and retention of women in technical disciplines globally. We envision a vibrant community of IEEE women and men collectively using their diverse talents to innovate for the benefit of humanity.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="mission fam-card col sm-24 md-24 lg-24">
                <p class="card-title">WATT's Mission</p>
                <p class="fam-card-description">We are a technical advocacy group for women and minorities in Electrical Engineering, operating as a branch of <a href="http://ieee.ucla.edu/">IEEE</a>. We empower both students at UCLA and younger girls in our community.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="page-content-photo" style="text-align: center;">
            <img src = "../img/backgroundphotos/social-house.jpg" style="width:700px; border-radius:6px;"/>

        </div>

        <div class="page-content" style="margin-bottom: 50px;">
            <p class="card-title">What We Do</p>
            <div class="home-div">
                <div class="col xs-8 sm-8 md-8" id="mission-container">
                    <i class="fas fa-tools fa-7x mission-icon"></i>
                    <p class="mission-yellow-subtitle">TINKER</p>
                    <p class="fam-card-description">We hold beginner-friendly workshops, providing small projects that teach members basic circuit and coding skills and give them room for creativity. We also have a year-long project for members looking for a more advanced way to apply their learning.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="col xs-8 sm-8 md-8" id="mission-container">
                    <i class="fas fa-magic fa-7x mission-icon"></i>
                    <p class="mission-yellow-subtitle">MENTORSHIP</p>
                    <p class="fam-card-description">Our <a href="/families">HogWATTs</a> mentorship program is a space for underclassmen to learn from and connect with upperclassmen as well as WATT alumni. Members also have an opportunity to mentor K - 12 students through volunteering events, helping young girls foster an interest in engineering.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="col xs-8 sm-8 md-8" id="mission-container">
                    <i class="fas fa-people-arrows fa-7x mission-icon"></i>
                    <p class="mission-yellow-subtitle">NETWORK</p>
                    <p class="fam-card-description">Members will be able to network with industry professionals through resume workshops and professional development events. Our joint events with SWE and ACM-W allow members to meet students from other clubs and develop more professional and social relationships.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="home-div">
            <div class="page-content-photo fam-card home-do-img col xs-24 sm-24 md-10"></div>
            <div class="page-content fam-card col xs-24 sm-24 md-14">
                <p class="card-title">How to Join</p>
                <p class="fam-card-description">Sign up for our email list and follow our facebook page to learn about workshops, socials, and other events that are open to everyone! Sign up for our mentorship program at the beginning of each school year to learn about mentorship-specific events.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>








</div>
{{> footer}}
